1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:03,280
Imagine you walk into a hospital
with a sprained ankle...

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:06,500
and all 50 doctors come running.

3
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:07,640
The heart surgeon.

4
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:08,450
The dentist.

5
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:09,700
The eye doctor.

6
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,540
All for one ankle.

7
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:13,220
Ridiculous, right?

8
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:16,250
But that's how a lot of AI models work.

9
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,300
Every word you type goes
through the whole model.

10
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,440
So engineers built a smarter hospital.

11
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:25,560
They hired a receptionist,
who takes one look at you...

12
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:28,110
and sends you to just 4 doctors.

13
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,320
Everyone else?

14
00:00:29,370 --> 00:00:30,400
Back to work.

15
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:33,550
In AI, the doctors are called experts,

16
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:38,040
the receptionist is the router, and the
trick is called Mixture of Experts.

17
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:40,600
Real AI experts aren't that tidy...

18
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:44,470
but this is why some giant
models are surprisingly fast.

19
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:46,210
But there's a catch.

20
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:48,970
All 50 doctors still need an office...

21
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:51,600
and in a computer, offices are memory.

22
00:00:51,770 --> 00:00:55,470
So giant hospitals only
fit in giant data centres.

23
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:59,140
Last month, researchers found
a clever way around it.

24
00:00:59,430 --> 00:01:01,870
Keep most doctors at home, on call.

25
00:01:02,090 --> 00:01:06,230
While one doctor works, the receptionist
predicts who's needed next...

26
00:01:06,230 --> 00:01:07,800
and calls them in early.

27
00:01:08,190 --> 00:01:09,110
The result?

28
00:01:09,490 --> 00:01:12,770
An AI with 35 billion parameters...

29
00:01:12,830 --> 00:01:17,360
running on one desktop computer,
in about 3 gigabytes of memory.

30
00:01:17,790 --> 00:01:18,880
Same hospital.

31
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:20,030
Same doctors.

32
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,960
Just a smarter receptionist.

33
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,860
Follow for more AI, explained like this.
